     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Dear all,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I am using Structural Equation Modelling (SEM) to assess interactions among socioeconomic, climatic and cognitive (latent) variables in explaining yard plant richness and composition.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">I have some concerns regarding sample size: n=117 against 6 independent variables, one of which is a latent variable composed of 4 items. Do you think that is a good ratio?</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span style=\"font-size:12.8px\">Also, my observations belong to six different metropolitan areas in the USA and I am not sure on how to deal with spatial autocorrelation. I am pretty sure I cannot perform multigroup analysis due to small sample size (15-22 observations per group). I attach a picture of the basic model.</span><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">If suggestion would be highly appreciated.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Thanks,</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;text-align:justify;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Padu</span></p></div>"
    ]
   ]
